{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/manhattan-samana-jvc","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":500,"crm_id":"474","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Samana Manhattan","slug":"manhattan-samana-jvc","display_address":"Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC)","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"2026","developer":"Samana Developers","price":792720,"display_price":"","lattitude":25.0464806,"longitude":55.2055847,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":"0","about":"<p>Manhattan - a luxury project by developer Samana, located in the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/jumeirah-village-circle/\">JVC</a> neighborhood. The complex has an amazing architecture, which combines graceful flowing and modern elements. High quality materials are used in the interiors, each residence has a private balcony, and many apartments have a private pool. There are picturesque views of the neighborhood and cityscapes.</p><p>Among the amenities of the complex are a large swimming pool with sun loungers and places to relax, Jacuzzi, gym and grounds for various sports and children's play areas. Shopping, cafes and restaurants are within walking distance.</p><p>The favorable location in the JVC area guarantees a comfortable atmosphere on the territory of the complex, as well as quick communication with key points of Dubai. Just a 5-minute drive away are such iconic locations as Circle Mall, Global Village entertainment complex, the famous Dubai Miracle Garden and Dubai Butterfly Garden parks and the popular coastal area of Dubai Marina. Within 15 minutes are the Business Bay and Downtown business districts, Burj Khalifa and the largest shopping and entertainment center in the world - Dubai Mall.</p><p>Manhattan is a modern complex in a vibrant and attractive neighborhood. With amenities and attention to every detail, this project offers the perfect blend of style, comfort and modernity for those looking for the perfect place to live.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/474/images/2024/01/13/gy7cjF4g5EDhoZQIWGJsYAhkuLVTtTmdRHplnCdx.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/01/13/gy7cjF4g5EDhoZQIWGJsYAhkuLVTtTmdRHplnCdx.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/474/images/2024/01/13/yIl9875YjE7tkOBqWqRFfcwp4FwhlnFr3FRM9898.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/01/13/yIl9875YjE7tkOBqWqRFfcwp4FwhlnFr3FRM9898.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/474/images/2024/01/13/ALxRn2IrsZsaqvDvBL4mmPti5jUBYOjJKVImmheo.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/01/13/ALxRn2IrsZsaqvDvBL4mmPti5jUBYOjJKVImmheo.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/474/images/2024/01/13/BGOwDSfu7dZch1Ir3BD6UmKWJJIuaFnGLtOPkpWZ.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/01/13/BGOwDSfu7dZch1Ir3BD6UmKWJJIuaFnGLtOPkpWZ.jpg","__ggfxIndex":3},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/474/images/2024/01/13/NK7gd1DSZfziGeDALqgcy1NE3jYCtqsJCaJ2cAxt.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/01/13/NK7gd1DSZfziGeDALqgcy1NE3jYCtqsJCaJ2cAxt.jpg","__ggfxIndex":4},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/474/images/2024/01/13/E0Zm7q0fiRQRWvwzSJohKH1oCsm7X66OlG60zs6E.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/01/13/E0Zm7q0fiRQRWvwzSJohKH1oCsm7X66OlG60zs6E.jpg","__ggfxIndex":5}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2932,"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/2023/10/03/kL5gmT7tedhJfv8pQE7YgUWQHvkxt85EeIwAz1R6.pdf","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},